DESCRIPTION:ENTITY presents … FSU College of Social Sciences and Public Policy Career Center Liaisons Fall 2026 Drop-In Advising Hours. Meet with Jessica O'Neill or Laura Hamilton to discuss Career Advising\, Resume and Cover Letter Writing\, Internships\, Part-time & Full-time job Searches\, Pre-Law Advising\, Graduate School Preparation\, and Interview Techniques on Mondays & Tuesdays from 2 - 4 pm in Bellamy 101A. Wednesdays and Fridays from 10 am - 12 pm in Bellamy 101A. Thursdays 2 - 4 pm virtually.
