DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in working in politics\, lobbying or the legislature? Attend Careers in Politics Networking Night to learn more and connect with professionals in the field from 5 to 7:30 p.m. Monday\, Oct. 26\, at the Alumni Center (1030 W. Tennessee St.).\n\n\n\n\n\nStudents will have the opportunity to network with and hear from both FSU alumni and political professionals about their experience within the industry.  \n\n\n\nThis event is open to all students interested in careers in politics\, lobbying or legislative work. Business attire is required. \n\n\n\nThis event is presented by Florida State University’s College of Social Sciences and Public Policy\, Career Center\, and Master’s in Applied American Politics and Policy program. \n\n\n\nTo learn more about the event and register\, visit bit.ly/2026Careers-in-Politics.
GEO:30.448424;-84.299765
LOCATION:Alumni Center 
SUMMARY:Fall 2026 Careers in Politics Networking Night
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/fall-2026-careers-in-politics-networking-night
CATEGORIES:Networking
END:VEVENT
