DESCRIPTION:The Department of Economics presents Leota's Lantern Trail! \n\n \n\nJoin us for Leota's Lantern Trail\, an enchanting Halloween experience filled with mystery\, magic\, and eerie surprises around every bend. Wander through a hauntingly illuminated trail where flickering lanterns will guide your path through a world inspired by ghostly legends\, enchanted forests\, and Halloween thrills.\n\nWhether you're seeking a fun fright\, festive atmosphere\, or simply a memorable evening. Bring your friends and family\; Leota's Lantern Trail offers something for everyone.\n\nTrick 'r Treating for all ages within the safety of the Bellamy Building 🍬🍬🍬\n\nEvent Details 📅 Date: October 30\, 2026\n⏰ Time: 5:30pm-7:30pm\n📍 Location: Department of Economics\n\nCome dressed in your favorite Halloweenattire and prepare for an unforgettable journey through the shadows. Don't miss your chance to experience the magic\, mystery\, and mischief that awaits along the trail.
GEO:30.443346;-84.295735
LOCATION:Bellamy Building (BEL)\, Department of Economics
SUMMARY: Leota's Lantern Trail
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/leotas-lantern-trail
CATEGORIES:Special Events
END:VEVENT
